<title>SPAIN: Spain's BCH cuts prime rate to 7.50 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's BCH cuts prime rate to 7.50 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Banco Central Hispano (BCH) said on Tuesday it cut its prime lending rate to 7.50 percent from 7.75 percent.</p>
<p>The move followed the Bank of Spain's 25 basis point cut in its key money rate to 5.50 percent.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
